oga. Aapne aisa hai ki aapne ek first complaint raise kiya hai. Fir wo ticket ID aayega na, fir we will follow.\nCustomer: Mobile se kyun nahi hota? Email pe email kyun dalna padta hai? Mobile ke upar mobile number confirm kar dijiye because mera mobile number registered hai aapke dukan mein. Duniya bhar ka messages aata rehta hai to uske hisab se bhi to aap ticket raise kar sakte ho na.\nAgent: Sir actually first complaint, aapko call se zyada better mail hai, just aapko ek text karna hai ki I have purchased sofa from this Duroflex.\nCustomer: Email ID bhejiye, aap email ID bhejiye.\nAgent: Baki wo hum khud check kar lenge sir, aap tension mat lijiye. Main aapko call karta hu Sunday ko, hum Monday ko visit karke check kar lenge kya toota hua hai, fir uska proper picture.\nCustomer: Kal koi nahi aa sakega kya? Kal koi nahi aa sakega kya Saturday ko?\nAgent: Nahi sir, Saturday Sunday thoda.\nCustomer: Are wo toota hua bed ke upar koi so nahi sakte na. Mera ladka bahar se USA aaya hai, uska bhi ek din uske upar se uska ye ho gaya, uske back ka problem ho gaya hai. Aur ye to medical bed ke hisab se kharida tha, wo to abhi ulta ho gaya hai. Wo back pain kam karne ke badle wo to badha diya hai ye.\nAgent: Sofa cum bed sir normal bed ke compare mein jo hamara wala tha wo better hai. But wo matlab aisa orthopedic sofa cum bed nahi hoti na sir wo.\nCustomer: I know but but then Duroflex ke ye hai ki isse kuch problem nahi hota hai. Anyway aap mail dijiye yaar, problem ye matlab yehi taklif hota hai jabhi kharidne ka aur baad mein complaint.\nAgent: Nahi nahi aap tension mat lijiye sir, we will aapka agar wo toota hai, hum change karwa denge. Aap tension mat lijiye, agar wo toota hai to we will change it. Main unse force karke change karwayenge.\nCustomer: Bhejiye mujhe bhejiye email.\nAgent: Ji ji, ji main bhejta hu. Okay."
}

